WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.960
There was a man named Job,
whole-hearted and upright.

2
00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:07.380
In one day he loses his
oxen, sheep, camels,

3
00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:10.170
servants and all ten children.

4
00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:14.340
Three friends come and sit with
him for seven days, silent.

5
00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:17.930
At last, God answers Job
out of the whirlwind.

6
00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:20.970
But God never mentions
why any of it happened.

7
00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:24.920
So when God finally speaks,
why doesn't He explain?

8
00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:28.240
In this mission, you'll
read the test, Job's lament,

9
00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:30.600
and his friend's view of suffering.

10
00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:33.150
Then you'll hear God's
questions from the whirlwind,

11
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.190
and see how Jewish readers
have understood the book.

12
00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:39.420
Your mission: find out
why God speaks to Job,

13
00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:40.990
but does not explain.
